{"id":"vol9-05","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-05/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":369.01,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":4.32,"text":"Part 2 You will hear a guide talking to a group of","words":[["Part",0.0,0.2],["2",0.2,0.62],["You",0.62,1.98],["will",1.98,2.14],["hear",2.14,2.34],["a",2.34,2.54],["guide",2.54,2.94],["talking",2.94,3.5],["to",3.5,3.8],["a",3.8,3.98],["group",3.98,4.14],["of",4.14,4.32]]},{"start":4.32,"end":11.46,"text":"visitors to Pioneer Historical Village. First you have some time to look at questions 11","words":[["visitors",4.32,4.66],["to",4.66,5.04],["Pioneer",5.04,5.74],["Historical",5.74,6.16],["Village.",6.16,6.78],["First",8.46,9.18],["you",9.18,9.4],["have",9.4,9.56],["some",9.56,9.72],["time",9.72,10.12],["to",10.12,10.36],["look",10.36,10.48],["at",10.48,10.62],["questions",10.62,10.94],["11",10.94,11.46]]},{"start":11.46,"end":46.36,"text":"to 14. Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 14.","words":[["to",11.46,11.72],["14.",11.72,12.26],["Now",42.76,43.16],["listen",43.16,43.46],["carefully",43.46,43.88],["and",43.88,44.24],["answer",44.24,44.58],["questions",44.58,44.96],["11",44.96,45.54],["to",45.54,45.82],["14.",45.82,46.36]]},{"start":49.93,"end":53.89,"text":"Hello everyone and welcome to Pioneer Historical Village.","words":[["Hello",49.93,50.47],["everyone",50.47,50.89],["and",50.89,51.25],["welcome",51.25,51.59],["to",51.59,51.97],["Pioneer",51.97,52.89],["Historical",52.89,53.27],["Village.",53.27,53.89]]},{"start":54.57,"end":59.85,"text":"It's an outdoor park recreated to look just like a village from the mid 19th century.","words":[["It's",54.57,54.87],["an",54.87,54.99],["outdoor",54.99,55.29],["park",55.29,55.87],["recreated",55.87,56.43],["to",56.43,56.73],["look",56.73,56.89],["just",56.89,57.33],["like",57.33,57.69],["a",57.69,57.83],["village",57.83,58.09],["from",58.09,58.35],["the",58.35,58.51],["mid",58.51,58.77],["19th",58.77,59.85],["century.",59.85,59.85]]},{"start":59.85,"end":67.23,"text":"Visitors can wander through the village, look inside the houses and get a feel for what life was like back then.","words":[["Visitors",59.85,61.07],["can",61.07,61.29],["wander",61.29,61.71],["through",61.71,62.03],["the",62.03,62.19],["village,",62.19,62.49],["look",62.81,63.07],["inside",63.07,63.53],["the",63.53,63.75],["houses",63.75,64.09],["and",64.09,64.75],["get",64.75,64.95],["a",64.95,65.07],["feel",65.07,65.37],["for",65.37,65.71],["what",65.71,65.87],["life",65.87,66.17],["was",66.17,66.35],["like",66.35,66.59],["back",66.59,66.85],["then.",66.85,67.23]]},{"start":68.05,"end":71.99,"text":"The village has grown somewhat since it was first opened to the public.","words":[["The",68.05,68.57],["village",68.57,68.81],["has",68.81,69.01],["grown",69.01,69.33],["somewhat",69.33,70.01],["since",70.01,70.35],["it",70.35,70.55],["was",70.55,70.67],["first",70.67,70.97],["opened",70.97,71.41],["to",71.41,71.61],["the",71.61,71.69],["public.",71.69,71.99]]},{"start":72.49,"end":80.51,"text":"Going back a bit, in 1962 a committee was formed in the hope of preserving some of the local history.","words":[["Going",72.49,72.63],["back",72.63,72.89],["a",72.89,73.11],["bit,",73.11,73.23],["in",73.87,73.91],["1962",73.91,74.83],["a",74.83,75.59],["committee",75.59,76.03],["was",76.03,76.37],["formed",76.37,76.83],["in",76.83,77.07],["the",77.07,77.17],["hope",77.17,77.53],["of",77.53,77.95],["preserving",77.95,78.57],["some",78.57,79.17],["of",79.17,79.43],["the",79.43,79.55],["local",79.55,79.91],["history.",79.91,80.51]]},{"start":81.17,"end":83.49,"text":"Many years of planning and fundraising followed.","words":[["Many",81.17,81.49],["years",81.49,81.85],["of",81.85,81.99],["planning",81.99,82.33],["and",82.33,82.57],["fundraising",82.57,82.87],["followed.",82.87,83.49]]},{"start":84.25,"end":89.23,"text":"Volunteers worked throughout the 1970s to restore and move buildings to the site.","words":[["Volunteers",84.25,84.81],["worked",84.81,85.19],["throughout",85.19,85.55],["the",85.55,85.79],["1970s",85.79,86.91],["to",86.91,87.03],["restore",87.03,87.59],["and",87.59,87.85],["move",87.85,88.09],["buildings",88.09,88.45],["to",88.45,88.77],["the",88.77,88.89],["site.",88.89,89.23]]},{"start":89.23,"end":93.75,"text":"In 1980 the village welcomed its first paying visitors.","words":[["In",89.23,90.07],["1980",90.07,90.95],["the",90.95,91.35],["village",91.35,91.59],["welcomed",91.59,92.09],["its",92.09,92.39],["first",92.39,92.77],["paying",92.77,93.25],["visitors.",93.25,93.75]]},{"start":94.55,"end":97.85,"text":"We'll go in now and I'll help you purchase your tickets.","words":[["We'll",94.55,95.15],["go",95.15,95.37],["in",95.37,95.51],["now",95.51,95.79],["and",95.79,96.39],["I'll",96.39,96.63],["help",96.63,96.85],["you",96.85,97.03],["purchase",97.03,97.37],["your",97.37,97.57],["tickets.",97.57,97.85]]},{"start":98.67,"end":103.27,"text":"Since there are 10 of you all together in this party, you qualify for the group discount.","words":[["Since",98.67,98.89],["there",98.89,99.13],["are",99.13,99.25],["10",99.25,99.43],["of",99.43,99.55],["you",99.55,99.69],["all",99.69,99.83],["together",99.83,100.15],["in",100.15,100.39],["this",100.39,100.59],["party,",100.59,100.91],["you",101.23,101.47],["qualify",101.47,101.91],["for",101.91,102.29],["the",102.29,102.43],["group",102.43,102.73],["discount.",102.73,103.27]]},{"start":104.01,"end":110.21,"text":"The normal price of admission is $16 for adults and $12.50 for students and seniors.","words":[["The",104.01,104.27],["normal",104.27,104.57],["price",104.57,104.95],["of",104.95,105.11],["admission",105.11,105.43],["is",105.43,105.67],["$16",105.67,106.19],["for",106.19,106.73],["adults",106.73,107.03],["and",107.03,107.35],["$12",107.35,107.77],[".50",107.77,108.27],["for",108.27,108.61],["students",108.61,109.21],["and",109.21,109.69],["seniors.",109.69,110.21]]},{"start":110.63,"end":116.93,"text":"But it'll only be $11 per person for all of you today, which is quite a saving.","words":[["But",110.63,110.99],["it'll",110.99,111.13],["only",111.13,111.47],["be",111.47,111.75],["$11",111.75,112.51],["per",112.51,113.29],["person",113.29,113.93],["for",113.93,114.21],["all",114.21,114.47],["of",114.47,114.61],["you",114.61,114.77],["today,",114.77,115.11],["which",115.37,115.79],["is",115.79,115.93],["quite",115.93,116.33],["a",116.33,116.57],["saving.",116.57,116.93]]},{"start":118.37,"end":124.87,"text":"Sometimes we have shows and demonstrations. We had hoped to show you how candles are made,","words":[["Sometimes",118.37,118.97],["we",118.97,119.57],["have",119.57,119.85],["shows",119.85,120.35],["and",120.35,120.75],["demonstrations.",120.75,121.27],["We",122.21,122.43],["had",122.43,122.83],["hoped",122.83,123.11],["to",123.11,123.33],["show",123.33,123.57],["you",123.57,123.75],["how",123.75,123.95],["candles",123.95,124.39],["are",124.39,124.59],["made,",124.59,124.87]]},{"start":125.09,"end":132.09,"text":"but the person organising it had to cancel at the last minute. You're all in for a treat of","words":[["but",125.09,125.37],["the",125.37,125.81],["person",125.81,126.21],["organising",126.21,126.95],["it",126.95,127.25],["had",127.25,127.85],["to",127.85,128.07],["cancel",128.07,128.51],["at",128.51,128.71],["the",128.71,128.81],["last",128.81,129.11],["minute.",129.11,129.45],["You're",130.17,130.77],["all",130.77,131.03],["in",131.03,131.21],["for",131.21,131.41],["a",131.41,131.61],["treat",131.61,131.89],["of",131.89,132.09]]},{"start":132.09,"end":139.67,"text":"another kind though. Just outside the shop we have an expert sweet maker who will be making lollipops","words":[["another",132.09,132.35],["kind",132.35,132.63],["though.",132.63,132.99],["Just",133.73,134.17],["outside",134.17,134.67],["the",134.67,135.05],["shop",135.05,135.41],["we",135.41,135.73],["have",135.73,135.97],["an",135.97,136.13],["expert",136.13,136.73],["sweet",136.73,137.27],["maker",137.27,137.75],["who",137.75,138.25],["will",138.25,138.45],["be",138.45,138.59],["making",138.59,138.99],["lollipops",138.99,139.67]]},{"start":139.67,"end":145.83,"text":"the old-fashioned way. So do go and have a look. If you want to make bread yourself,","words":[["the",139.67,139.95],["old",139.95,140.35],["-fashioned",140.35,140.77],["way.",140.77,141.19],["So",141.63,141.95],["do",141.95,142.21],["go",142.21,142.47],["and",142.47,142.65],["have",142.65,142.79],["a",142.79,142.97],["look.",142.97,143.11],["If",144.09,144.49],["you",144.49,144.65],["want",144.65,144.81],["to",144.81,144.99],["make",144.99,145.15],["bread",145.15,145.33],["yourself,",145.33,145.83]]},{"start":145.83,"end":152.85,"text":"head to the bakery and have a go. The space is quite small though so no spectators please.","words":[["head",145.83,146.49],["to",146.49,146.69],["the",146.69,146.77],["bakery",146.77,147.15],["and",147.15,147.65],["have",147.65,147.95],["a",147.95,148.11],["go.",148.11,148.33],["The",149.07,149.25],["space",149.25,149.59],["is",149.59,149.95],["quite",149.95,150.23],["small",150.23,150.61],["though",150.61,151.01],["so",151.01,151.41],["no",151.41,151.75],["spectators",151.75,152.49],["please.",152.49,152.85]]},{"start":154.07,"end":159.87,"text":"You'll have a chance to interact with some farm animals today. We used to keep cows in the dairy","words":[["You'll",154.07,154.59],["have",154.59,154.71],["a",154.71,154.81],["chance",154.81,155.17],["to",155.17,155.43],["interact",155.43,155.85],["with",155.85,156.07],["some",156.07,156.29],["farm",156.29,156.61],["animals",156.61,156.97],["today.",156.97,157.33],["We",157.87,158.11],["used",158.11,158.47],["to",158.47,158.65],["keep",158.65,158.83],["cows",158.83,159.17],["in",159.17,159.41],["the",159.41,159.51],["dairy",159.51,159.87]]},{"start":159.87,"end":165.87,"text":"but someone had to be here twice a day to milk them and it became difficult to manage.","words":[["but",159.87,160.59],["someone",160.59,161.07],["had",161.07,161.41],["to",161.41,161.59],["be",161.59,161.83],["here",161.83,162.11],["twice",162.11,162.49],["a",162.49,162.87],["day",162.87,163.13],["to",163.13,163.43],["milk",163.43,163.77],["them",163.77,164.01],["and",164.01,164.21],["it",164.21,164.33],["became",164.33,164.67],["difficult",164.67,165.27],["to",165.27,165.59],["manage.",165.59,165.87]]},{"start":166.95,"end":174.25,"text":"Chickens are everywhere though, not just on the farms. Every house kept a few for the eggs.","words":[["Chickens",166.95,167.63],["are",167.63,168.11],["everywhere",168.11,168.77],["though,",168.77,169.33],["not",169.69,169.95],["just",169.95,170.25],["on",170.25,170.51],["the",170.51,170.61],["farms.",170.61,171.13],["Every",171.85,172.31],["house",172.31,172.67],["kept",172.67,172.95],["a",172.95,173.19],["few",173.19,173.39],["for",173.39,173.73],["the",173.73,173.93],["eggs.",173.93,174.25]]},{"start":174.25,"end":178.45,"text":"You're welcome to have a look and see if you can find any to collect.","words":[["You're",174.25,175.19],["welcome",175.19,175.51],["to",175.51,175.79],["have",175.79,175.93],["a",175.93,176.05],["look",176.05,176.21],["and",176.21,176.45],["see",176.45,176.75],["if",176.75,176.99],["you",176.99,177.13],["can",177.13,177.31],["find",177.31,177.59],["any",177.59,177.81],["to",177.81,178.03],["collect.",178.03,178.45]]},{"start":179.86,"end":183.21,"text":"Goats were another favourite animal, but they caused trouble too.","words":[["Goats",179.86,180.15],["were",180.15,180.39],["another",180.39,180.71],["favourite",180.71,181.05],["animal,",181.05,181.47],["but",181.65,181.83],["they",181.83,182.19],["caused",182.19,182.53],["trouble",182.53,182.89],["too.",182.89,183.21]]},{"start":183.83,"end":187.41,"text":"They're fun to feed, but they eat everything in sight.","words":[["They're",183.83,184.07],["fun",184.07,184.19],["to",184.19,184.35],["feed,",184.35,184.71],["but",185.11,185.25],["they",185.25,185.45],["eat",185.45,185.73],["everything",185.73,186.57],["in",186.57,186.91],["sight.",186.91,187.41]]},{"start":188.78,"end":191.67,"text":"The ones that we had have moved to a nearby farm.","words":[["The",188.78,189.07],["ones",189.07,189.33],["that",189.33,189.53],["we",189.53,189.67],["had",189.67,190.01],["have",190.01,190.39],["moved",190.39,190.65],["to",190.65,190.87],["a",190.87,190.99],["nearby",190.99,191.13],["farm.",191.13,191.67]]},{"start":195.31,"end":200.85,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 15-20.","words":[["Before",195.31,195.89],["you",195.89,196.15],["hear",196.15,196.37],["the",196.37,196.55],["rest",196.55,196.79],["of",196.79,196.91],["the",196.91,197.01],["talk,",197.01,197.31],["you",197.71,197.87],["have",197.87,198.05],["some",198.05,198.23],["time",198.23,198.63],["to",198.63,198.87],["look",198.87,198.99],["at",198.99,199.13],["questions",199.13,199.49],["15",199.49,200.25],["-20.",200.25,200.85]]},{"start":231.32,"end":234.56,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 15-20.","words":[["Now",231.32,231.74],["listen",231.74,232.0],["and",232.0,232.4],["answer",232.4,232.74],["questions",232.74,233.18],["15",233.18,233.96],["-20.",233.96,234.56]]},{"start":238.02,"end":244.0,"text":"Now, you'll probably want some time to explore the village. Please open your maps and we'll","words":[["Now,",238.02,238.54],["you'll",238.94,239.38],["probably",239.38,239.74],["want",239.74,239.98],["some",239.98,240.2],["time",240.2,240.52],["to",240.52,240.68],["explore",240.68,241.04],["the",241.04,241.22],["village.",241.22,241.58],["Please",242.08,242.48],["open",242.48,243.0],["your",243.0,243.16],["maps",243.16,243.48],["and",243.48,243.84],["we'll",243.84,244.0]]},{"start":244.0,"end":245.12,"text":"have a look at the layout.","words":[["have",244.0,244.22],["a",244.22,244.38],["look",244.38,244.54],["at",244.54,244.7],["the",244.7,244.8],["layout.",244.8,245.12]]},{"start":246.6,"end":251.7,"text":"We'll enter through the main gate which is at the bottom of your map. So, if you'd like","words":[["We'll",246.6,247.12],["enter",247.12,247.42],["through",247.42,247.7],["the",247.7,247.86],["main",247.86,248.14],["gate",248.14,248.5],["which",248.5,248.8],["is",248.8,248.92],["at",248.92,249.02],["the",249.02,249.12],["bottom",249.12,249.46],["of",249.46,249.7],["your",249.7,249.8],["map.",249.8,250.1],["So,",250.58,250.96],["if",251.14,251.32],["you'd",251.32,251.52],["like",251.52,251.7]]},{"start":251.7,"end":256.14,"text":"to see the schoolhouse, that's a good first stop because it's not too far from the gate.","words":[["to",251.7,251.9],["see",251.9,252.02],["the",252.02,252.2],["schoolhouse,",252.2,252.86],["that's",253.14,253.44],["a",253.44,253.56],["good",253.56,253.78],["first",253.78,254.08],["stop",254.08,254.46],["because",254.46,254.7],["it's",254.7,254.9],["not",254.9,255.06],["too",255.06,255.28],["far",255.28,255.56],["from",255.56,255.78],["the",255.78,255.9],["gate.",255.9,256.14]]},{"start":257.0,"end":262.02,"text":"If you head directly north, you'll come to a beautiful old church. The schoolhouse","words":[["If",257.0,257.22],["you",257.22,257.3],["head",257.3,257.44],["directly",257.44,257.78],["north,",257.78,258.16],["you'll",258.54,258.74],["come",258.74,258.96],["to",258.96,259.14],["a",259.14,259.26],["beautiful",259.26,259.64],["old",259.64,260.14],["church.",260.14,260.56],["The",261.2,261.4],["schoolhouse",261.4,262.02]]},{"start":262.02,"end":263.74,"text":"is diagonally across from it.","words":[["is",262.02,262.24],["diagonally",262.24,262.9],["across",262.9,263.2],["from",263.2,263.54],["it.",263.54,263.74]]},{"start":265.04,"end":270.08,"text":"The mill is quite interesting, that's where they ground wheat to make flour for baking.","words":[["The",265.04,265.6],["mill",265.6,265.78],["is",265.78,266.0],["quite",266.0,266.22],["interesting,",266.22,266.62],["that's",267.12,267.64],["where",267.64,267.8],["they",267.8,268.0],["ground",268.0,268.36],["wheat",268.36,268.68],["to",268.68,269.06],["make",269.06,269.26],["flour",269.26,269.6],["for",269.6,269.8],["baking.",269.8,270.08]]},{"start":270.66,"end":275.52,"text":"To find it, go straight up from the main gate until you get to the clock tower.","words":[["To",270.66,271.08],["find",271.08,271.36],["it,",271.36,271.58],["go",271.9,272.02],["straight",272.02,272.44],["up",272.44,272.74],["from",272.74,272.96],["the",272.96,273.08],["main",273.08,273.28],["gate",273.28,273.7],["until",273.7,274.14],["you",274.14,274.38],["get",274.38,274.56],["to",274.56,274.76],["the",274.76,274.86],["clock",274.86,275.14],["tower.",275.14,275.52]]},{"start":276.1,"end":280.54,"text":"Turn right and it's on the other side of the road, across from the pond.","words":[["Turn",276.1,276.42],["right",276.42,276.76],["and",276.76,277.22],["it's",277.22,277.5],["on",277.5,277.7],["the",277.7,277.86],["other",277.86,278.12],["side",278.12,278.46],["of",278.46,278.58],["the",278.58,278.64],["road,",278.64,279.04],["across",279.38,279.78],["from",279.78,280.12],["the",280.12,280.26],["pond.",280.26,280.54]]},{"start":281.92,"end":285.34,"text":"Then there are the stables where the horses were kept.","words":[["Then",281.92,282.48],["there",282.48,282.96],["are",282.96,283.24],["the",283.24,283.44],["stables",283.44,284.02],["where",284.02,284.46],["the",284.46,284.58],["horses",284.58,284.86],["were",284.86,285.12],["kept.",285.12,285.34]]},{"start":286.1,"end":291.06,"text":"You may have seen the back of the stables already because they're a large building backing","words":[["You",286.1,286.3],["may",286.3,286.44],["have",286.44,286.56],["seen",286.56,286.82],["the",286.82,287.02],["back",287.02,287.28],["of",287.28,287.5],["the",287.5,287.6],["stables",287.6,287.96],["already",287.96,288.34],["because",288.34,288.78],["they're",288.78,289.3],["a",289.3,289.42],["large",289.42,289.94],["building",289.94,290.54],["backing",290.54,291.06]]},{"start":291.06,"end":292.06,"text":"on to the car park.","words":[["on",291.06,291.34],["to",291.34,291.5],["the",291.5,291.62],["car",291.62,291.82],["park.",291.82,292.06]]},{"start":292.06,"end":296.76,"text":"If you head west past the church, it's the first building you come to.","words":[["If",292.06,293.08],["you",293.08,293.18],["head",293.18,293.32],["west",293.32,293.82],["past",293.82,294.2],["the",294.2,294.44],["church,",294.44,294.68],["it's",295.06,295.4],["the",295.4,295.5],["first",295.5,295.78],["building",295.78,296.12],["you",296.12,296.3],["come",296.3,296.54],["to.",296.54,296.76]]},{"start":298.08,"end":300.5,"text":"Medical care was quite basic in those days.","words":[["Medical",298.08,298.6],["care",298.6,298.92],["was",298.92,299.08],["quite",299.08,299.32],["basic",299.32,299.78],["in",299.78,299.94],["those",299.94,300.14],["days.",300.14,300.5]]},{"start":300.88,"end":305.18,"text":"To get an idea of what it was like, you might like to visit the doctor's office.","words":[["To",300.88,301.04],["get",301.04,301.16],["an",301.16,301.3],["idea",301.3,301.52],["of",301.52,301.76],["what",301.76,301.88],["it",301.88,301.98],["was",301.98,302.1],["like,",302.1,302.42],["you",302.64,302.76],["might",302.76,303.08],["like",303.08,303.42],["to",303.42,303.66],["visit",303.66,304.04],["the",304.04,304.28],["doctor's",304.28,304.82],["office.",304.82,305.18]]},{"start":306.14,"end":311.4,"text":"Look in the middle of your maps, and it's in a block of three buildings that are all close together.","words":[["Look",306.14,306.4],["in",306.4,306.64],["the",306.64,306.74],["middle",306.74,307.04],["of",307.04,307.24],["your",307.24,307.36],["maps,",307.36,307.7],["and",307.98,308.16],["it's",308.16,308.32],["in",308.32,308.52],["a",308.52,308.62],["block",308.62,308.9],["of",308.9,309.2],["three",309.2,309.56],["buildings",309.56,310.0],["that",310.0,310.26],["are",310.26,310.4],["all",310.4,310.7],["close",310.7,310.98],["together.",310.98,311.4]]},{"start":312.02,"end":312.7,"text":"It's one of them.","words":[["It's",312.02,312.26],["one",312.26,312.4],["of",312.4,312.52],["them.",312.52,312.7]]},{"start":314.04,"end":316.26,"text":"There's even an old hotel.","words":[["There's",314.04,314.56],["even",314.56,315.0],["an",315.0,315.28],["old",315.28,315.62],["hotel.",315.62,316.26]]},{"start":316.26,"end":322.18,"text":"Well, go up past the picnic area and the hotel is on the opposite side of the path near the pond.","words":[["Well,",316.26,316.44],["go",316.9,317.24],["up",317.24,317.42],["past",317.42,317.7],["the",317.7,317.88],["picnic",317.88,318.06],["area",318.06,318.44],["and",318.44,318.8],["the",318.8,318.92],["hotel",318.92,319.3],["is",319.3,319.64],["on",319.64,319.78],["the",319.78,319.9],["opposite",319.9,320.28],["side",320.28,320.66],["of",320.66,320.78],["the",320.78,320.86],["path",320.86,321.18],["near",321.18,321.74],["the",321.74,321.92],["pond.",321.92,322.18]]},{"start":323.56,"end":326.14,"text":"Another place to see is the workshop.","words":[["Another",323.56,324.2],["place",324.2,324.5],["to",324.5,324.76],["see",324.76,324.96],["is",324.96,325.58],["the",325.58,325.76],["workshop.",325.76,326.14]]},{"start":326.92,"end":332.16,"text":"It's at the end of that narrow winding path just south of the picnic area,","words":[["It's",326.92,327.52],["at",327.52,327.68],["the",327.68,327.98],["end",327.98,328.32],["of",328.32,328.54],["that",328.54,328.76],["narrow",328.76,329.2],["winding",329.2,329.76],["path",329.76,330.26],["just",330.26,330.66],["south",330.66,331.0],["of",331.0,331.24],["the",331.24,331.34],["picnic",331.34,331.68],["area,",331.68,332.16]]},{"start":332.46,"end":337.52,"text":"which is on the right hand side of your map at the eastern end of the village.","words":[["which",332.46,332.8],["is",332.8,332.92],["on",332.92,333.1],["the",333.1,333.22],["right",333.22,333.54],["hand",333.54,333.82],["side",333.82,334.24],["of",334.24,334.42],["your",334.42,334.58],["map",334.58,335.02],["at",335.02,335.52],["the",335.52,335.68],["eastern",335.68,336.22],["end",336.22,336.7],["of",336.7,337.06],["the",337.06,337.24],["village.",337.24,337.52]]},{"start":338.46,"end":341.36,"text":"The village has been here since...","words":[["The",338.46,339.1],["village",339.1,339.62],["has",339.62,340.0],["been",340.0,340.24],["here",340.24,340.58],["since...",340.58,341.36]]},{"start":344.28,"end":346.2,"text":"That is the end of part two.","words":[["That",344.28,344.86],["is",344.86,345.0],["the",345.0,345.14],["end",345.14,345.44],["of",345.44,345.6],["part",345.6,345.8],["two.",345.8,346.2]]},{"start":346.2,"end":350.18,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 2.","words":[["You",346.2,346.96],["now",346.96,347.22],["have",347.22,347.54],["30",347.54,347.9],["seconds",347.9,348.3],["to",348.3,348.58],["check",348.58,348.84],["your",348.84,349.0],["answers",349.0,349.4],["to",349.4,349.64],["Part",349.64,349.82],["2.",349.82,350.18]]},{"start":354.33,"end":361.01,"text":"You will hear two environmental study students called Annie and Ryan discussing with their","words":[["You",354.33,355.13],["will",355.13,355.33],["hear",355.33,355.59],["two",355.59,356.03],["environmental",356.03,356.71],["study",356.71,357.25],["students",357.25,357.83],["called",357.83,358.27],["Annie",358.27,358.67],["and",358.67,359.01],["Ryan",359.01,359.35],["discussing",359.35,360.43],["with",360.43,360.83],["their",360.83,361.01]]},{"start":361.01,"end":366.91,"text":"tutor a presentation they will give on disposing of dangerous household waste products.","words":[["tutor",361.01,361.29],["a",361.29,361.63],["presentation",361.63,362.07],["they",362.07,362.57],["will",362.57,362.71],["give",362.71,362.99],["on",362.99,363.69],["disposing",363.69,364.31],["of",364.31,364.51],["dangerous",364.51,364.99],["household",364.99,365.69],["waste",365.69,366.19],["products.",366.19,366.91]]}]}